                                "sense_id": "585afb3a-920f-3b3c-8e85-050e09df8ba4",
                                "text": "Next day further heavy sanding of the lines was carried out by standard Class \"3\" 2-6-2 tank No. 82028 from the Scarborough end and Class \"4\" 2-6-4 tank No. 42084 from Whitby."
